{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>HaShem is righteous.</b> And therefore he said this thing about the hail more than about all the other plagues, because the Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: ״Send, gather your livestock״ — and whoever did not gather them into the house died. Therefore he said to him: HaShem is righteous — for He warned me well, and I and my people are the wicked ones, for in their wickedness they left their livestock in the fields and did not believe in the Holy One, blessed be He."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:52.141660680Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}